# Server-only — nutrition-staff's origin, INCLUDING its shared /api
# prefix (route constants in api/public-api-route.ts are resource paths
# only, e.g. "/public/site-settings" — this base URL owns the /api
# segment, joined via frontend-toolkit-core's joinUrl). Never exposed to
# the browser (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix): the browser never talks to
# nutrition-staff directly, only through this app's own /api/* proxy
# routes. Named API_URL, not STAFF_API_BASE_URL — this app has exactly
# one upstream backend, so frontend-toolkit-core's
# createLazyEnvBaseUrlConfig() reads this name by default with zero
# configuration. See docs/architecture.md ("Public data flow").
API_URL=http://localhost:3333/api

# Shared secret nutrition-staff uses to authenticate calls to this app's
# /api/revalidate endpoint — must match the REVALIDATE_SECRET nutrition-staff
# is configured with. Generate your own (e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`) —
# never reuse the same value across environments.
REVALIDATE_SECRET=<random-hex-secret>
